                        ],
                        "form": "postronnych"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "48da2581-6169-3adc-a428-5b5529b11e86",
                        "entry_id": "9121c653-05ce-3acd-8f17-2ad2d90d7e7d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "outside, third-party"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d92c41c9-8be3-4ec7-8934-9a0c491cc7cc",
                                "sense_id": "48da2581-6169-3adc-a428-5b5529b11e86",
                                "text": "Czego dowiaduje się bardziej postronny czytelnik o rzeczonym publicyście i poecie[...] ?",
                                "translation": "What does a more uninvolved reader learn about said political writer and poet … ?",
                                "english": "What does a more uninvolved reader learn about said political writer and poet … ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0468780f-29ae-4c06-97dd-f119b7f0dbec",
                                "sense_id": "48da2581-6169-3adc-a428-5b5529b11e86",
                                "text": "osoba postronna",
                                "translation": "outsider",
                                "english": "outsider"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3a1678c-ea8a-4a4a-9979-0c2d55b9384f",
                                "sense_id": "48da2581-6169-3adc-a428-5b5529b11e86",
                                "text": "Kurczęta trzeba wysadzić z gniazda na miejsce postronniejsze [...]",
                                "translation": "You have to move the chicks out of the nest to a place farther away …",
                                "english": "You have to move the chicks out of the nest to a place farther away …"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35798930-545f-433c-b7b3-9b92d3d5ff7b",
                                "sense_id": "48da2581-6169-3adc-a428-5b5529b11e86",
                                "text": "Rzecz w tym, że sekretarz sądowy zwyczajnie wyświetlacza nie przestawił. - I to na oczach klientów - komentuje postronny prawnik z korytarza.",
                                "translation": "The thing about it is that the court secretary didn't reset the display screen in the normal way. \"And that was before the clients' eyes,\" comments an uninvolved lawyer from the hallway.",
                                "english": "The thing about it is that the court secretary didn't reset the display screen in the normal way. \"And that was before the clients' eyes,\" comments an uninvolved lawyer from the hallway."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a4aef9d-1c52-4dad-b55b-8b22c846009e",
                                "sense_id": "48da2581-6169-3adc-a428-5b5529b11e86",
                                "text": "Pisałam, że postronny obserwator, na przykład dziecko, może sądzić, że nasza flaga to obraz tęczy po prostu.",
                                "translation": "I wrote that an outside observer, for instance a child, might just think that the picture of the rainbow is our flag.",
                                "english": "I wrote that an outside observer, for instance a child, might just think that the picture of the rainbow is our flag."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06e5f8b6-33ab-4dec-90ef-5bec51c3cb5b",
                                "sense_id": "48da2581-6169-3adc-a428-5b5529b11e86",
                                "text": "[...] takim mógł się przynajmniej wydawać postronnemu obserwatorowi.",
                                "translation": "… he could seem like that, at least, to an outside observer.",
                                "english": "… he could seem like that, at least, to an outside observer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f82ac0e-cb53-47c2-bbc7-f2dd13020170",
                                "sense_id": "48da2581-6169-3adc-a428-5b5529b11e86",
                                "text": "Postronny widz, który nie zna tajników polskiej polityki, mógłby dojść do wniosku, że Andrzeja Dudę czeka marny los ze strony prezesa PiS.",
                                "translation": "An outside viewer, who doesn't know the arcana of Polish politics, might come to the conclusion that a bad fate awaits Andrzej Duda at the hands of the leader of [the political party] PiS.",
                                "english": "An outside viewer, who doesn't know the arcana of Polish politics, might come to the conclusion that a bad fate awaits Andrzej Duda at the hands of the leader of [the political party] PiS."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "83374bf3-bcf8-3f9a-8290-d0dc9a5a8745",
                        "entry_id": "9121c653-05ce-3acd-8f17-2ad2d90d7e7d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "side, incidental, not main or most important"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "063f120d-bb02-46e8-b668-3b4418f276f2",
                                "sense_id": "83374bf3-bcf8-3f9a-8290-d0dc9a5a8745",
                                "text": "Robię dosyć wiele; oprócz różnych postronnych, mimojazdowych pisań, kropię moje poema, którego pieśń czwartą dziś kończę.",
                                "translation": "I am doing a lot; apart from various incidental side writings, I am quickly writing my poem, whose fourth song I am finishing today.",
                                "english": "I am doing a lot; apart from various incidental side writings, I am quickly writing my poem, whose fourth song I am finishing today."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "578bb603-2d33-42e7-9644-db9899e4cfcd",
                                "sense_id": "83374bf3-bcf8-3f9a-8290-d0dc9a5a8745",
                                "text": "[...] chłop szukał postronnego zarobku.",
                                "translation": "… the peasant sought side income.",
                                "english": "… the peasant sought side income."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "32677e75-df92-3d4d-ac2b-2de8632d9453",
                        "entry_id": "9121c653-05ce-3acd-8f17-2ad2d90d7e7d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "adjacent, bordering"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "909309a1-eba6-48b9-9750-08abd9e5adbc",
                                "sense_id": "32677e75-df92-3d4d-ac2b-2de8632d9453",
                                "text": "Nie brakło wprawdzie i ujemnych cech tego życia obozowego, tej butnej samowoli, która nieraz prowadziła paniąt tutejszych na zuchwałe wyprawy do ziem postronnych, wbrew czasem rzeczywistym interesom Rzeczypospolitej.",
                                "translation": "In truth, too, there was no lack of negative characteristics of this camp life, this arrogant lawlessness, which often led the young local noblemen on reckless expeditions to neighboring lands, sometimes contrary to the real interests of the Commonwealth.",
                                "english": "In truth, too, there was no lack of negative characteristics of this camp life, this arrogant lawlessness, which often led the young local noblemen on reckless expeditions to neighboring lands, sometimes contrary to the real interests of the Commonwealth."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
